WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:03.264
获取可保存的示例响应 / Fetch the source response

2
00:00:03.264 --> 00:00:06.242
选中 source 请求 / Select the source request

3
00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:20.430
打开 Response 正文 / Open the Response body

4
00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:24.568
Save body 保存 guide-response.json / Save body as guide-response.json

5
00:00:24.568 --> 00:00:27.401
确认产品保存了完整正文 / Verify the product-saved body

6
00:00:27.401 --> 00:00:30.306
打开 Guide response breakpoint / Open the response Rule

7
00:00:30.306 --> 00:00:33.201
展开断点阶段 / Open the breakpoint phase options

8
00:00:33.201 --> 00:00:36.051
选择 response 阶段 / Select response phase

9
00:00:36.051 --> 00:00:38.953
Apply 响应断点 / Apply the response breakpoint

10
00:00:38.953 --> 00:00:41.862
返回 Capture / Return to Capture

11
00:00:41.862 --> 00:00:44.752
发出 header-only 并等待响应 / Pause the header-only response

12
00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:47.810
选中响应断点 / Select the paused response

13
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.908
保持 Body Off / Keep body replacement Off

14
00:00:50.908 --> 00:00:54.161
仅修改 x-guide-response / Edit only x-guide-response

15
00:00:54.161 --> 00:00:57.203
Forward edited，正文保持原样 / Forward the Header edit without changing body

16
00:00:57.203 --> 00:01:00.066
发出 Text 示例响应 / Pause the Text example response

17
00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:03.110
选中 Text 示例 / Select the Text example

18
00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:06.316
选择 Text / Choose Text replacement

19
00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:09.510
输入 text-from-guide / Enter text-from-guide

20
00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:12.555
Forward edited，核对 Text 字节 / Forward and verify the Text bytes

21
00:01:12.555 --> 00:01:15.506
发出 File 示例响应 / Pause the File example response

22
00:01:15.506 --> 00:01:18.661
选中 File 示例 / Select the File example

23
00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:35.515
选择 File / Choose File replacement

24
00:01:35.515 --> 00:01:40.572
选择产品保存的 guide-response.json / Select the product-saved guide-response.json

25
00:01:40.572 --> 00:01:43.960
折叠响应头，完整查看文件预览 / Collapse Headers to read the File preview

26
00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.107
Forward edited，核对完整文件字节 / Forward and verify the complete file bytes

27
00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:50.006
返回响应规则 / Return to the response Rule

28
00:01:50.006 --> 00:01:52.855
停用响应断点 / Disable the response breakpoint

29
00:01:52.855 --> 00:01:55.708
Apply 停用状态 / Apply the disabled state
